1
00:00:01,210 --> 00:00:04,710
[♪ opening theme song playing]

2
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:14,810
DAEMONS OF THE SHADOW REALM

3
00:01:31,010 --> 00:01:32,050
[DERA] Come on, lady,

4
00:01:32,090 --> 00:01:34,050
this is no time
to be takin' a nap.

5
00:01:34,090 --> 00:01:37,100
If you don't wanna die,
you better open your eyes!

6
00:01:37,140 --> 00:01:38,270
[woman groans softly]

7
00:01:38,310 --> 00:01:39,930
-[DERA] Wake up!
-[woman yells]

8
00:01:40,940 --> 00:01:42,390
[WOMAN] What the...

9
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:44,400
-Tadera?
-On your feet.

10
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:46,810
-Get ready to beat it.
-Wait.

11
00:01:47,820 --> 00:01:49,530
What is this place?

12
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:51,690
[both chuckle]

13
00:01:51,740 --> 00:01:53,780
[screams] Who are they?

14
00:01:53,820 --> 00:01:56,320
So you're not their master.
I figured.

15
00:01:56,370 --> 00:01:58,910
After all,
they killed your friends.

16
00:01:58,950 --> 00:02:01,830
[WOMAN] They weren't my friends.
And those aren't my daemons.

17
00:02:01,870 --> 00:02:04,960
Well, great.
There's a third party, then.

18
00:02:05,420 --> 00:02:07,630
-[both chuckle]
-[DERA] What do they want?

19
00:02:07,670 --> 00:02:11,090
And how did they
get into the clan's Lost House?

20
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:14,800
You seem to know
these stretched-out freaks.

21
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,340
Yes, you could say that.

22
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:18,140
Many centuries ago,

23
00:02:18,180 --> 00:02:20,390
they were causing problems
in the north.

24
00:02:20,430 --> 00:02:23,560
We aided a traveling monk
who wielded the power of Seal

25
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:26,190
and trapped the pair
inside Mount Yamou.

26
00:02:26,230 --> 00:02:27,560
[WOMAN]
Mount... what now?

27
00:02:27,610 --> 00:02:29,020
[DERA] Mount Bandai.

28
00:02:29,070 --> 00:02:32,190
It was renamed after an eruption
changed its shape.

29
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:34,660
Explain. You were sealed away,

30
00:02:34,700 --> 00:02:36,360
so how is it
you came to be here?

31
00:02:36,410 --> 00:02:38,410
[LONG-LEG] A stroke of luck.

32
00:02:38,450 --> 00:02:41,620
We have a kind new master
who recently dispelled

33
00:02:41,660 --> 00:02:43,250
the miserable seal.

34
00:02:43,290 --> 00:02:44,830
[LONG-ARM]
Freedom tastes so sweet

35
00:02:44,870 --> 00:02:47,290
after a thousand years
of imprisonment.

36
00:02:47,330 --> 00:02:50,800
Finally, our captors
stand before us.

37
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:53,340
Now you mutts are gonna pay.

38
00:02:53,380 --> 00:02:56,180
[LONG-LEG] Whatever happened
to that contemptible monk?

39
00:02:56,220 --> 00:02:57,510
No idea.

40
00:02:57,550 --> 00:02:59,930
The last we heard,
he was on Mount Koya.

41
00:02:59,970 --> 00:03:02,720
I've heard stories
about these two.

42
00:03:02,770 --> 00:03:04,220
From what I remember,

43
00:03:04,270 --> 00:03:06,940
the leggy one
tramples fields and crops.

44
00:03:06,980 --> 00:03:09,310
Meanwhile, the other one
scoops up lake water,

45
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:11,690
causing disastrous floods.

46
00:03:11,730 --> 00:03:14,190
-Such slander!
-Damn villagers.

47
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:16,530
They've been spreading
lies and nonsense

48
00:03:16,570 --> 00:03:19,160
while we were suffering
in a mountain prison.

49
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:21,240
That's not
our style of mischief.

50
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,200
We're innocent!

51
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:24,710
The only thing we're guilty of

52
00:03:24,750 --> 00:03:27,290
is eating a few people
now and then. [chuckles]

53
00:03:27,330 --> 00:03:29,920
Children taste especially sweet.

54
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:32,250
[both laugh]

55
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:37,050
[LONG-LEG] I see a tender
young morsel among you. [laughs]

56
00:03:37,090 --> 00:03:39,800
[LONG-ARM] He looks like
he's starting to toughen up.

57
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,680
But he'll still suffice.

58
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:45,560
Now, which of you
is Left and Right's master?

59
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:47,600
[woman gasps] Uh...

60
00:03:47,640 --> 00:03:51,020
[LONG-LEG] Interesting.
If Left and Right are here,

61
00:03:51,060 --> 00:03:53,230
does that mean
a set of twins has been born?

62
00:03:53,270 --> 00:03:55,610
Be careful, Long-Arm.

63
00:03:55,650 --> 00:03:58,030
One of them may wield Seal.

64
00:03:58,070 --> 00:04:00,820
[LONG-ARM] We will not be
sealed away again, Long-Leg.

65
00:04:00,870 --> 00:04:02,700
We must act.

66
00:04:02,740 --> 00:04:04,370
Left and Right, kill them!

67
00:04:04,410 --> 00:04:07,080
-[RIGHT] Uh?
-Obey my command!

68
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:10,540
What? Do you think
you can just order us around?

69
00:04:16,670 --> 00:04:17,970
Huh.

70
00:04:18,590 --> 00:04:20,340
At once, Master!

71
00:04:20,380 --> 00:04:21,970
-If that's your wish.
-[Dera chuckles]

72
00:04:22,010 --> 00:04:24,760
EPISODE 10
LONG-ARM AND LONG-LEG

73
00:04:25,770 --> 00:04:27,940
[LONG-ARM] The runner
is controlling them.

74
00:04:27,980 --> 00:04:29,060
We'll take our time

75
00:04:29,140 --> 00:04:31,350
-devouring the boy later.
-[Yuru gasps]

76
00:04:31,940 --> 00:04:33,020
[both grunting]

77
00:04:33,270 --> 00:04:35,440
[LONG-ARM] Their master
will be the first to die!

78
00:04:36,940 --> 00:04:39,200
-[Right grunting]
-[Long-Arm grunts]

79
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:43,240
[Right grunts]

80
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,320
[Long-Arm screams]

81
00:04:57,090 --> 00:04:58,590
[Right grunting]

82
00:04:58,630 --> 00:05:00,380
-[Long-Arm chuckles]
-[gunshots]

83
00:05:03,510 --> 00:05:04,890
What's this?

84
00:05:04,930 --> 00:05:07,010
He's launching
some sort of pellets at us.

85
00:05:07,060 --> 00:05:08,480
[Dera grunts]

86
00:05:10,350 --> 00:05:11,690
[Long-Arm laughs]

87
00:05:11,730 --> 00:05:13,150
[Long-Arm yells]

88
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:19,400
[Long-Arm laughs]

89
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:20,860
They're fast.

90
00:05:21,030 --> 00:05:24,370
And so slippery, it's impossible
to hold them for very long.

91
00:05:24,410 --> 00:05:27,700
Conspicuous that nobody's
using Seal.

92
00:05:27,740 --> 00:05:30,660
Perhaps its wielder
isn't actually here.

93
00:05:31,500 --> 00:05:33,130
[LONG-LEG]
Is this meager strength

94
00:05:33,170 --> 00:05:34,920
all you can muster on your own?

95
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:38,460
I was hoping you'd present
a challenge. [laughs]

96
00:05:38,500 --> 00:05:40,460
[Long-Arm laughs]

97
00:05:40,510 --> 00:05:43,680
Without the accursed monk
and his ability,

98
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:45,470
you're too weak.

99
00:05:45,510 --> 00:05:48,720
We've craved revenge
for 1,200 years.

100
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:53,600
[LONG-ARM]
We deserve retribution. [laughs]

101
00:05:53,640 --> 00:05:56,400
-Those two are terrifying!
-Dera!

102
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:57,480
Oh, Yuru.

103
00:05:57,520 --> 00:05:59,780
You didn't bat an eye
at my improv.

104
00:05:59,820 --> 00:06:01,690
-Nicely done.
-[YURU] Are you insane?

105
00:06:01,740 --> 00:06:03,450
Why the heck
would you wanna lie

106
00:06:03,490 --> 00:06:04,910
about being
Left and Right's master

107
00:06:04,950 --> 00:06:06,240
in the first place?

108
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:08,490
Now those daemons
are targeting you.

109
00:06:08,790 --> 00:06:11,410
Simple. I'm your guardian, kid.

110
00:06:11,450 --> 00:06:14,120
Plus, your cute little sister
told me to watch your back.

111
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:17,210
Left and Right
went along with it, too.

112
00:06:17,250 --> 00:06:19,050
I can protect myself, you know.

113
00:06:19,090 --> 00:06:22,130
You wanna try
and fight Tenaga-Ashinaga?

114
00:06:22,170 --> 00:06:24,760
You must have a death wish.
[gasps]

115
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:26,760
-[woman grunts]
-Talk fast.

116
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:30,100
Are you with the village?
Or the Kagemoris?

117
00:06:31,060 --> 00:06:32,640
[grunting]

118
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,140
[laughs]

119
00:06:38,860 --> 00:06:41,110
[DERA] You're wasting time
we don't have.

120
00:06:41,150 --> 00:06:42,690
Who sent you?

121
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:45,240
It was the Kagemoris.

122
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:47,120
[woman screams]

123
00:06:47,620 --> 00:06:50,950
There are different factions
within the Kagemori clan.

124
00:06:50,990 --> 00:06:52,250
Who sent you after us?

125
00:06:52,290 --> 00:06:54,870
[WOMAN] The second son, Asuma!

126
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:57,540
[ASUMA] The village
that produces Break and Seal

127
00:06:57,580 --> 00:06:59,170
should be allowed to live on.

128
00:06:59,210 --> 00:07:01,800
We mustn't reject
their very existence.

129
00:07:01,840 --> 00:07:03,130
That said,

130
00:07:03,170 --> 00:07:05,840
they need to be controlled
by suitable overseers.

131
00:07:06,380 --> 00:07:07,550
That guy?

132
00:07:08,390 --> 00:07:10,100
You might wanna know.

133
00:07:10,140 --> 00:07:13,310
I was told not to harm anybody,
especially you.

134
00:07:13,350 --> 00:07:17,020
Our assignment was to shadow you
and report back to him.

135
00:07:17,060 --> 00:07:18,060
Damn it!

136
00:07:18,110 --> 00:07:19,980
Why'd we have to go
and get dragged

137
00:07:20,020 --> 00:07:22,520
into some kind of centuries old
daemon feud?

138
00:07:22,570 --> 00:07:24,360
I don't wanna die!

139
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:33,330
Good news.
At the very least,

140
00:07:33,370 --> 00:07:35,870
it sounds like this old bag
won't try to murder us.

141
00:07:35,910 --> 00:07:37,120
Okay.

142
00:07:37,290 --> 00:07:39,790
You must be a Daemon Wielder.
That much is clear.

143
00:07:39,830 --> 00:07:41,090
Yeah, so?

144
00:07:41,130 --> 00:07:42,170
You can help us.

145
00:07:42,750 --> 00:07:44,630
Summon your daemons to fight.

146
00:07:44,670 --> 00:07:45,880
Can't do it.

147
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:48,090
We all left ours behind
for the mission.

148
00:07:48,130 --> 00:07:51,010
Left and Right would've noticed
other daemons in a heartbeat.

149
00:07:51,050 --> 00:07:52,600
Not that it helped at all.

150
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:54,720
But we were tailing you
on our own today.

151
00:07:54,770 --> 00:07:56,640
You are useless!

152
00:07:57,810 --> 00:07:59,690
What was it
you were saying earlier?

153
00:07:59,730 --> 00:08:02,020
This place
is a Lost House, right?

154
00:08:02,060 --> 00:08:04,320
So what are we doing
still sitting around?

155
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:07,150
Let's bolt and leave
Tenaga-Ashinaga behind.

156
00:08:07,190 --> 00:08:08,360
Not an option.

157
00:08:08,950 --> 00:08:11,530
Those two already know
how to get in and out.

158
00:08:11,570 --> 00:08:14,160
If we run, they'll follow us
with their master.

159
00:08:14,200 --> 00:08:15,330
It won't work.

160
00:08:15,370 --> 00:08:16,540
Right.

161
00:08:16,660 --> 00:08:19,120
Then I'll hunt for whoever
is controlling them.

162
00:08:19,500 --> 00:08:21,920
Daemons want
to protect their masters.

163
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:24,000
Theirs is here somewhere.

164
00:08:24,050 --> 00:08:26,010
Hiding nearby, I'd guess.

165
00:08:26,050 --> 00:08:27,510
Yeah, true.

166
00:08:27,550 --> 00:08:29,550
And they'd probably
underestimate you

167
00:08:29,590 --> 00:08:32,010
'cause they think
you're some random kid.

168
00:08:32,050 --> 00:08:33,300
Right.

169
00:08:33,390 --> 00:08:36,270
And I can move around freely
with minimal danger.

170
00:08:36,310 --> 00:08:38,480
In fact,
since they both think

171
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:40,730
you're the one who's controlling
Left and Right,

172
00:08:40,770 --> 00:08:43,730
it's likely they'll ignore me
so long as you are alive.

173
00:08:43,770 --> 00:08:46,570
[DERA] That's a plan.
I'll work with Left and Right

174
00:08:46,610 --> 00:08:48,820
to draw Tenaga-Ashinaga's
attention.

175
00:08:48,860 --> 00:08:50,700
You look for their master.

176
00:08:51,110 --> 00:08:52,870
Well, Granny? You in?

177
00:08:52,910 --> 00:08:55,080
[woman whimpers]

178
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:58,660
[WOMAN] Fine.
Not like I have a choice.

179
00:08:59,460 --> 00:09:01,790
[Yuru gasps] Hidden knives!

180
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:05,880
[WOMAN] Let's get this over with
so I can go home.

181
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:09,050
I have to cook dinner
for my loving husband.

182
00:09:09,090 --> 00:09:11,430
[DERA]
Housewives are terrifying.

183
00:09:14,010 --> 00:09:15,220
[Right grunting]

184
00:09:17,850 --> 00:09:20,100
[Long-Arm laughs]

185
00:09:20,680 --> 00:09:22,600
Huh? [chuckles]

186
00:09:24,810 --> 00:09:26,940
[DERA]
Now to sneak into the armory.

187
00:09:27,730 --> 00:09:28,900
[Dera grunts]

188
00:09:30,820 --> 00:09:32,280
[Dera grunts]

189
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:33,780
[Long-Arm grunting]

190
00:09:40,330 --> 00:09:41,540
[Long-Arm laughs]

191
00:09:45,340 --> 00:09:47,670
[Right grunts, yells]

192
00:09:52,050 --> 00:09:53,220
[Dera groans]

193
00:09:53,300 --> 00:09:56,300
How long do those
damn arms stretch, anyway?

194
00:09:57,350 --> 00:10:00,310
Ah! The idiots
wrecked my house.

195
00:10:00,810 --> 00:10:04,980
Oh, well. On the plus side,
now I've got a shortcut.

196
00:10:06,110 --> 00:10:08,020
[woman panting]

197
00:10:08,070 --> 00:10:10,280
[WOMAN]
Tenaga-Ashinaga's master...

198
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:13,450
Where are you? Show yourself!

199
00:10:18,780 --> 00:10:21,250
I found the... [stammers]

200
00:10:21,290 --> 00:10:24,540
[YURU] Sheesh. Dera said
people had died here,

201
00:10:24,580 --> 00:10:27,960
but this is a lot of corpses!

202
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,840
The master would be
easier to track

203
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:33,840
if they were exuding bloodlust.

204
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:37,470
Think, Yuru.
Where could they be hiding?

205
00:10:38,430 --> 00:10:39,760
Damn statues.

206
00:10:39,810 --> 00:10:42,230
You're as tough
to break as ever.

207
00:10:42,270 --> 00:10:46,310
Perhaps their master would be
easier to dispose of first!

208
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:47,730
Yes, perhaps!

209
00:10:47,980 --> 00:10:51,820
How fitting to abandon them
in this place as stray daemons,

210
00:10:51,860 --> 00:10:55,320
forced to rot in a Lost House
till they fade away

211
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:56,740
-into nothing!
-[gunshot]

212
00:10:56,780 --> 00:10:58,120
[LONG-ARM] Uh?

213
00:10:58,780 --> 00:11:00,240
No! Long-Leg!

214
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:02,750
What happened to your eye?

215
00:11:02,790 --> 00:11:03,910
Was it magic?

216
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:05,370
I... I don't know!

217
00:11:05,410 --> 00:11:07,420
Who did this?

218
00:11:07,790 --> 00:11:10,960
[DERA] Good,
not immune to bullets.

219
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:13,550
They said themselves
they've been sealed for years,

220
00:11:13,590 --> 00:11:16,340
so that means they're not
used to modern tech.

221
00:11:16,670 --> 00:11:19,100
I'm more than happy
to introduce them.

222
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:22,970
I don't know what holding
a thousand-year grudge is like,

223
00:11:23,020 --> 00:11:26,890
but hurt feelings mean nothing
on the other end of a gun.

224
00:11:27,390 --> 00:11:29,150
You're on my turf now.

225
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,690
You can't do whatever you want.

226
00:11:32,610 --> 00:11:34,150
[Long-Arm screams]

227
00:11:34,690 --> 00:11:36,700
Long-Arm!

228
00:11:37,780 --> 00:11:38,910
[Right chuckles]

229
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:43,370
[Right grunts]

230
00:11:44,250 --> 00:11:47,040
[groans] I'm blind!

231
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:49,500
There's something dangerous
flying at us!

232
00:11:49,540 --> 00:11:50,630
But where...

233
00:11:50,670 --> 00:11:52,630
[Right grunts]

234
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:54,510
[Long-Leg grunting]

235
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:57,090
-[LEFT] Heads up!
-[Long-Leg screams]

236
00:11:57,970 --> 00:11:59,090
[Right grunts]

237
00:11:59,130 --> 00:12:00,430
[Long-Arm screams]

238
00:12:09,980 --> 00:12:12,860
[LONG-ARM AND LONG-LEG]
Damn you!

239
00:12:13,900 --> 00:12:18,950
[both scream] Damn you all!

240
00:12:18,990 --> 00:12:20,450
Ah, crap.

241
00:12:20,490 --> 00:12:23,450
They'll be able to see me
from that vantage.

242
00:12:23,490 --> 00:12:24,830
[Long-Arm chuckles]

243
00:12:24,870 --> 00:12:27,620
What's this? [laughs]

244
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:33,040
-[woman whimpers]
-[LONG-ARM] I found us a snack.

245
00:12:33,090 --> 00:12:36,170
It's aged meat,
but it'll have to do.

246
00:12:36,210 --> 00:12:40,590
Women are more tender than men,
and they have great flavor.

247
00:12:40,630 --> 00:12:43,470
We need the sustenance to heal.

248
00:12:43,510 --> 00:12:46,270
Long-Leg! You should have
the first bite! Dig in!

249
00:12:46,310 --> 00:12:49,520
Ah, you're too kind.
But I will!

250
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:52,480
[woman whimpers]
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

251
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:55,270
I'm sure the kid I was with
would taste way better!

252
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:56,820
Ah! More importantly...

253
00:12:56,860 --> 00:12:59,700
he's the twin
who will inherit Seal!

254
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:01,450
[BOTH] Huh?

255
00:13:01,530 --> 00:13:04,280
[DERA] Damn old bag!
She spilled the beans!

256
00:13:04,330 --> 00:13:06,030
[LONG-ARM] Come again?

257
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,290
[WOMAN] It's the truth!

258
00:13:07,330 --> 00:13:09,460
Wouldn't it be better
to eat him?

259
00:13:09,500 --> 00:13:11,870
That child you were with
is Seal?

260
00:13:12,630 --> 00:13:15,290
Truly? Hmm.

261
00:13:15,340 --> 00:13:17,550
[LONG-LEG]
Listen again, Long-Arm.

262
00:13:17,590 --> 00:13:20,920
She said this child
may become Seal.

263
00:13:20,970 --> 00:13:23,220
[LONG-ARM] And this brat
who is yet to gain

264
00:13:23,260 --> 00:13:26,310
the power of Seal
is trapped in here with us.

265
00:13:26,350 --> 00:13:27,850
[woman groans softly]

266
00:13:27,890 --> 00:13:29,480
[WOMAN] Yeah, that's it.

267
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:30,980
Look around for the kid.

268
00:13:31,020 --> 00:13:32,810
The moment
you loosen your grip,

269
00:13:32,850 --> 00:13:34,610
I'll cut your
wrist tendons open

270
00:13:34,650 --> 00:13:36,190
and get free!
[chuckles softly]

271
00:13:36,230 --> 00:13:37,360
[woman groans]

272
00:13:37,400 --> 00:13:39,610
[LONG-LEG]
As exciting as that may be,

273
00:13:39,650 --> 00:13:41,780
we still need food to heal.

274
00:13:41,820 --> 00:13:44,570
-[Long-Arm chuckles]
-[woman grunting]

275
00:13:50,660 --> 00:13:52,120
[woman screams]

276
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,170
[RIGHT] Gotcha.

277
00:13:53,210 --> 00:13:54,500
[LONG-ARM] Huh?

278
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:57,290
[YURU] Get your filthy hands
off that woman.

279
00:13:57,340 --> 00:13:59,840
She has a family waiting
for her at home.

280
00:14:00,470 --> 00:14:02,010
I'm one of the fated twins,

281
00:14:02,050 --> 00:14:03,930
born to sunder night and day.

282
00:14:03,970 --> 00:14:04,970
While we're at it,

283
00:14:05,010 --> 00:14:07,140
I'm Left and Right's
real master.

284
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:08,890
You got a problem?

285
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:10,810
Take it up with me!

286
00:14:10,850 --> 00:14:11,890
DAEMONS OF THE SHADOW REALM

287
00:14:14,350 --> 00:14:17,570
You mean you are not only
one of the fated twins of lore,

288
00:14:17,980 --> 00:14:21,400
but you even command
the Divine Guardians?

289
00:14:21,990 --> 00:14:25,910
But the appetizer told us
you're the one to inherit Seal.

290
00:14:25,950 --> 00:14:29,660
That which is yet to happen
cannot yet be a problem for us.

291
00:14:29,700 --> 00:14:33,830
[LONG-ARM] Indeed!
So what should we do with him?

292
00:14:33,870 --> 00:14:35,420
If we kill this morsel,

293
00:14:35,460 --> 00:14:37,750
he will obtain
the power we fear.

294
00:14:37,790 --> 00:14:39,590
[LONG-LEG]
I will not have a repeat

295
00:14:39,630 --> 00:14:41,510
of what happened last time.

296
00:14:41,550 --> 00:14:45,220
[LONG-ARM] Maybe act fast
and simply kill him twice!

297
00:14:45,260 --> 00:14:46,850
[LONG-LEG] What of his mutts?

298
00:14:46,880 --> 00:14:48,930
You must realize
they won't stand there

299
00:14:48,970 --> 00:14:51,730
and let us end
their master's life, Long-Arm.

300
00:14:51,770 --> 00:14:53,770
Yes. What of them?

301
00:14:53,810 --> 00:14:54,850
Indeed.

302
00:14:54,890 --> 00:14:56,600
[YURU]
Left and Right, stay there.

303
00:14:56,650 --> 00:14:58,060
[RIGHT] What?

304
00:14:58,110 --> 00:15:00,940
[YURU] I don't want you
to do anything until I say so.

305
00:15:01,610 --> 00:15:03,610
This job falls to me.

306
00:15:03,650 --> 00:15:05,110
[Right sighs softly]

307
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:11,910
[BOTH] As you command!

308
00:15:11,950 --> 00:15:14,120
[laughs, grunts]

309
00:15:20,380 --> 00:15:21,630
[LONG-ARM] Huh?

310
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:23,800
[Long-Arm laughs]

311
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:25,220
The stupid mutts!

312
00:15:25,260 --> 00:15:28,550
They really aren't doing
anything to try and stop us!

313
00:15:29,220 --> 00:15:32,970
Even the most disobedient
of dogs can be taught to "stay!“

314
00:15:33,010 --> 00:15:34,310
How can he move so well?

315
00:15:34,350 --> 00:15:36,520
He doesn't even have eyes
to see where he's going!

316
00:15:36,560 --> 00:15:38,520
If I should lack in sight,

317
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:41,900
I may always trust Long-Arm
to act as my eyes!

318
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:45,110
And if I lack mobility,

319
00:15:45,150 --> 00:15:47,360
I may always trust
Long-Leg to move me

320
00:15:47,400 --> 00:15:48,990
wherever I need to go!

321
00:15:49,030 --> 00:15:50,700
[Yuru yells, grunts]

322
00:15:50,740 --> 00:15:52,450
[Long-Arm laughs]

323
00:15:52,490 --> 00:15:54,580
Together, we are complete!

324
00:15:54,620 --> 00:15:56,910
Two minds, one body!

325
00:15:56,960 --> 00:15:59,080
Behold, our perfected form!

326
00:15:59,130 --> 00:16:02,040
[BOTH] We are Tenaga-Ashinaga!

327
00:16:02,090 --> 00:16:03,420
[Yuru grunts]

328
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:11,390
[DERA] Damn worms.

329
00:16:11,430 --> 00:16:13,310
They're too big
to wriggle like that!

330
00:16:13,350 --> 00:16:15,010
Why are they so fast?

331
00:16:15,060 --> 00:16:16,270
I can't find a shot!

332
00:16:24,900 --> 00:16:26,110
[Dera grunts]

333
00:16:26,150 --> 00:16:29,070
Don't think you're
hiding from us over there!

334
00:16:29,110 --> 00:16:31,070
After we're done
devouring the child,

335
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:32,410
we'll eat you next!

336
00:16:32,450 --> 00:16:33,660
[Dera grunts]

337
00:16:37,410 --> 00:16:39,120
[Yuru grunting]

338
00:16:43,090 --> 00:16:44,840
[Long-Arm growling]

339
00:16:49,550 --> 00:16:51,050
[LONG-ARM] Huh?

340
00:16:51,930 --> 00:16:53,100
[Yuru gasps]

341
00:16:55,810 --> 00:16:56,890
Good.

342
00:16:57,640 --> 00:16:59,850
[Long-Arm growling]

343
00:17:02,270 --> 00:17:04,270
[Long-Arm grunting]

344
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:12,740
[Yuru gasps]

345
00:17:14,950 --> 00:17:16,200
Yuru!

346
00:17:37,680 --> 00:17:40,770
Now, which part to eat first?

347
00:17:40,810 --> 00:17:44,100
Should we tear off his left arm
and bleed him out?

348
00:17:44,150 --> 00:17:46,770
[LONG-LEG] Perhaps we should
rip out his tongue

349
00:17:46,820 --> 00:17:49,360
so he can't ask
Left and Right for help!

350
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:52,650
[Long-Leg and Long-Arm
laughing]

351
00:17:52,700 --> 00:17:53,990
[Yuru grunts]

352
00:17:54,990 --> 00:17:56,950
[Long-Arm gasps]

353
00:17:57,580 --> 00:17:58,950
[LONG-ARM] The little brat!

354
00:17:58,990 --> 00:18:00,290
Was it a lie?

355
00:18:00,330 --> 00:18:02,580
Has he already claimed Seal?

356
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:04,380
Just like before...

357
00:18:04,750 --> 00:18:08,630
That man lied to us in order to
draw our attention towards him!

358
00:18:09,510 --> 00:18:10,670
[Long-Arm grunting]

359
00:18:11,130 --> 00:18:13,800
[LONG-ARM] Was this all a trick
to catch us off-guard?

360
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:16,430
And now that we're too close
to avoid anything,

361
00:18:16,470 --> 00:18:18,390
he'll Seal us away again?

362
00:18:19,220 --> 00:18:21,180
[YURU] Glad to see
my ruse worked.

363
00:18:21,220 --> 00:18:22,310
[Long-Arm gasps]

364
00:18:22,850 --> 00:18:25,140
Your hesitation
may have only bought me

365
00:18:25,190 --> 00:18:26,610
a few moments of safety.

366
00:18:26,650 --> 00:18:29,780
But that's all the time
Left and Right need.

367
00:18:29,820 --> 00:18:31,690
-Now go!
-[LONG-ARM] Huh?

368
00:18:33,030 --> 00:18:34,610
[YURU] Do as you please!

369
00:18:34,860 --> 00:18:37,200
[grunting]

370
00:18:37,870 --> 00:18:40,080
[LEFT]
You have injured our master.

371
00:18:40,120 --> 00:18:42,910
So now, pay the price!

372
00:18:57,340 --> 00:19:00,390
[LONG-LEG] Long-Arm!
Where are you?

373
00:19:01,100 --> 00:19:03,520
I can't do anything without you!

374
00:19:03,560 --> 00:19:06,560
Please find me
and be my eyes again!

375
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:10,020
Why aren't you calling out?
Long-Arm!

376
00:19:10,070 --> 00:19:13,360
[LONG-ARM] I'm here, Long-Leg!
I'm right here.

377
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:15,860
I need you to save me...

378
00:19:15,900 --> 00:19:17,780
-[crunch]
-[Long-Arm groans]

379
00:19:19,830 --> 00:19:21,700
[Right chuckles]

380
00:19:25,460 --> 00:19:26,620
[RIGHT] Huh?

381
00:19:27,790 --> 00:19:29,630
[LONG-LEG] Long-Arm!

382
00:19:30,540 --> 00:19:31,800
Help!

383
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:33,170
[gunshot]

384
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:36,720
[Long-Leg groans]

385
00:19:48,390 --> 00:19:49,900
[Dera sighs]

386
00:20:11,500 --> 00:20:14,380
[LEFT] So these are
the creatures' relics.

387
00:20:14,420 --> 00:20:16,090
They're steeped in power.

388
00:20:16,130 --> 00:20:18,010
They'd have been gods
of some renown

389
00:20:18,050 --> 00:20:19,930
had they used
their strength better.

390
00:20:19,970 --> 00:20:21,640
Are you all right?

391
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:23,180
-Speak, lad!
-[Yuru coughs]

392
00:20:23,220 --> 00:20:24,600
[YURU] Yeah, sure.

393
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:27,520
Great job.
Your gambit worked out!

394
00:20:27,560 --> 00:20:28,770
[YURU] Hm.

395
00:20:32,770 --> 00:20:37,070
[YURU] When I saw Asa use Break,
she opened a closed fist.

396
00:20:37,690 --> 00:20:39,490
I kind of assumed
Seal would work

397
00:20:39,530 --> 00:20:41,070
in the opposite direction.

398
00:20:41,570 --> 00:20:43,910
It worked.
I scared them half to death.

399
00:20:43,950 --> 00:20:46,240
Even those monsters
would be terrified

400
00:20:46,290 --> 00:20:48,000
if you could seal them away
in an instant.

401
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:49,620
And I kinda get it.

402
00:20:50,210 --> 00:20:51,710
I see.

403
00:20:51,750 --> 00:20:55,300
When you put it like that,
it's dangerous.

404
00:20:55,340 --> 00:20:58,550
This was mighty reckless
of you though, lad.

405
00:20:58,590 --> 00:21:01,340
They were too much
for a human without Seal.

406
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:03,430
I wasn't trying to win.

407
00:21:03,470 --> 00:21:05,640
Just serve as a distraction
for you.

408
00:21:06,060 --> 00:21:08,470
So evading them was merely
the means to achieve

409
00:21:08,520 --> 00:21:09,600
your true goal?

410
00:21:09,770 --> 00:21:13,230
[YURU] Yeah. Like I said,
I had a job to do.

411
00:21:13,480 --> 00:21:14,940
[ALL] Huh?

412
00:21:15,190 --> 00:21:16,360
Found it.

413
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:18,610
This is the presence
we've felt for a while,

414
00:21:18,650 --> 00:21:21,110
ever since we left
the Kagemori manor.

415
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:24,240
It was so minute,
it was hard to track.

416
00:21:24,280 --> 00:21:26,410
[RIGHT] Then the humans
who were following us

417
00:21:26,450 --> 00:21:29,250
were only there
to pull our focus from this?

418
00:21:29,290 --> 00:21:32,920
This butterfly was
the real tail the entire time?

419
00:21:32,960 --> 00:21:34,790
[WOMAN] That thing
is Asuma's daemon.

420
00:21:34,840 --> 00:21:37,300
Or rather,
what you killed just now

421
00:21:37,340 --> 00:21:38,920
is a piece of the whole daemon.

422
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:41,340
You haven't done
any damage to them.

423
00:21:41,380 --> 00:21:44,050
Not if you only get rid of one.

424
00:21:54,810 --> 00:21:57,440
[♪ closing theme song playing]

425
00:23:24,860 --> 00:23:27,820
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

426
00:23:27,870 --> 00:23:28,950
[YURU] You're serious?

427
00:23:28,990 --> 00:23:30,870
[Ken screams]
Please, don't kill me!

428
00:23:30,910 --> 00:23:32,370
[YURU]
So this is your son, Dera?

429
00:23:32,410 --> 00:23:34,870
[DERA] I 100% haven't
heard that name before!

430
00:23:34,910 --> 00:23:36,500
This kid isn't mine!

431
00:23:36,830 --> 00:23:39,920
EPISODE 11
BIG BROTHER AND LITTLE BROTHER
